!—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————!
! Sour Gas Mechanism (SGM), Basic Version
! 	D. Bongartz, A.F. Ghoniem
!
! Assembled on 7/7/2014:
! 1) Aramco Mech 1.3:
!	VERSION: AramcoMech 1.3
!	AUTHORS: W. K. Metcalfe, S. Burke, H. J. Curran
!	WEBSITE: http://c3.nuigalway.ie/
!
! 2) Zhou et al. PROCI 34 (2013) mechanism
!	(deleted reactions 217-248 from the Zhou mechanism
!	 because these are O-H reactions which are covered
!	 by AramcoMech)
!
! 3. Since the heat of formation of SH was changed to 33.8kcal/mol, the
!    high pressure rate parameters for 2SH(+M)=HSSH(+M) had to be adjusted
!
! 4. The rates of 15 sulfur reactions (marked !mod) were optimized
!
! NOTE: To avoid convergence problems
!	- remove C reactions in cases without carbon species
!	- add small amounts (X=1e-9) of Ar, He, and N2 if
!	  these species are not present anyway. As an alternative,
!	  remove the reactions that explicitly contain these species
!	  as third body
!
!—————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————!

!-----------------------------------------------------------------------------!
ELEMENTS
C
H
N
O
AR
HE
S
END
!-----------------------------------------------------------------------------!
SPECIES
H                   H2                  O                   O2                  
OH                  OH*                 H2O                 N2                  
HO2                 H2O2                AR                  CO                  
